---
import BaseLayout from "../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Rclone Personal Drive Access">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Rclone Personal Drive Access</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This application is for personal use by the site owner. It uses Google
        OAuth to allow rclone to access the owner's Google Drive after explicit
        authorization.
      </p>

      <h2>Data access and use</h2>
      <p>
        Google Drive data is accessed only to perform file operations requested
        by the account owner through rclone. The application does not operate a
        separate backend database for storing Google Drive content.
      </p>

      <h2>Data sharing</h2>
      <p>
        User data is not sold, rented, or shared with third parties for
        advertising, analytics, or other unrelated purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        OAuth credentials and rclone configuration are stored locally in the
        owner's environment. The website itself does not store Google Drive
        files or OAuth tokens.
      </p>

      <h2>Revoking access</h2>
      <p>
        The account owner can revoke the application's Google account access at
        any time from the Google Account security settings.
      </p>

      <p>
        <a href="/apps/rclone/">Back to application information</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
